{"id":"skoro","lemma":"скоро","pos":"adv","rank":210,"glosses":["soon","speedily, quickly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы скоро уходим?","en":"Are we leaving soon?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926486","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to leave","l":"уходить"}]},{"text":"Он скоро будет здесь?","en":"Will he be here soon?","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Ты скоро будешь готова?","en":"Will you be ready soon?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Он скоро вернётся домой.","en":"He will soon return home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655534","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to return","l":"вернуться"},{"g":"home"}]},{"text":"Я скоро пойду.","en":"I'll go soon.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]}]}